        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en"># Included processes\nWind turbine substructure (including transition piece), at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.\nData of material inputs are based on the IEA reference 15MW offshore wind turbine using a monopile substructure.\nThe distance to installation port is assumed to be 80 km. The average water depth is 18 m. \nAssumed lifetime is 25 years.\n\nMain data source for material composition: \nRenewable Energy Material Property Database, REMPD (Cooperman et al., 2023)\nIEA Wind TCP Task 37 Definition of the IEA Wind 15-Megawatt Offshore Reference Wind Turbine (Technical Report NREL/TP-5000-75698). IEA Wind TCP. https://www.nrel.gov/docs/fy20osti/75698.pdf (Gaertner, et al., 2020)</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
        </technology>
    </processInformation>
